  "created_at": "2026-11-08T18:33:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-08T18:33:00Z",
  "body": "> This unfortunately not compatible with any style preprocessor as they are executed separately from the template compilation infra. (and it also obviously incompatible with JIT compilation)\n\nThe native css is very capable nowadays and preprocessors are becoming less valuable. Angular offers plain .css as an option, is it possible to make it a .css specific featue? Since its scoped to the components is should not affect libraries. JIT can be documented as a known limitation. Most projects use AOT anyways.",
